[
    {
        "content": "<p>I'm using <code>Nat.nextPowerOfTwo</code>, for which there seem to be no lemmas anywhere. I asked about this previously at <a href=\"#narrow/channel/217875-Is-there-code-for-X.3F/topic/API.20for.20.60Nat.2EnextPowerOfTwo.60\">#Is there code for X? &gt; API for &#96;Nat.nextPowerOfTwo&#96;</a>.</p>\n<p>I'm wondering if adding such lemmas to any repository makes sense. I realize that reviewers (of all projects) are overwhelmed and that this is not a priority. However, depending on how \"bad\" the proofs currently are, maybe this is <em>easy</em> to review, since it's just simple lemmas? </p>\n<p><strong>Main question: Right now, should lemmas like this (narrow scope, this level of quality) be contributed to core (or batteries, or Mathlib?) or does it have negative value due to creating work for reviewers/maintainers?</strong></p>\n<p>All material related to <code>Nat.nextPowerOfTwo</code> is currently in Lean core.<br>\nMy first instinct would be to add the following code to  <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/5e4e690888b6a1f3eb9c97b85753688c25d9ac31/src/Init/Data/Nat/Power2/Lemmas.lean\">Init/Data/Nat/Power2/Lemmas.lean</a>. I also <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/compare/master...adomasbaliuka:lean4:feat/Lemmas_Nat_nextPowerOfTwo\">tested this</a> on that version.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">le_nextPowerOfTwo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nextPowerOfTwo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le_go</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decide</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le_go</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">power</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">power</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nextPowerOfTwo</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">go</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">power</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">unfold</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nextPowerOfTwo</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">go</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">split</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">le_go</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">power</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mul_pos</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decide</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">omega</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">termination_by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">power</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">decreasing_by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp_wf</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nextPowerOfTwo_dec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;;&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">assumption</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nextPowerOfTwo_le</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isPowerOfTwo</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nextPowerOfTwo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">go_le</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decide</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isPowerOfTwo_one</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">pos_of_isPowerOfTwo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hm</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">go_le</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">power</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">h₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">power</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">h₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">power</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isPowerOfTwo</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hpm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">power</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isPowerOfTwo</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nextPowerOfTwo</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">go</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">power</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">unfold</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nextPowerOfTwo</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">go</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">split</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rename_i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hlt</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">go_le</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">power</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mul_pos</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decide</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">isPowerOfTwo_mul_two_of_isPowerOfTwo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₂</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hn</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">obtain</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₂</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">obtain</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hm</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pow_succ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">ex